{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Experience the Timber Fever</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get hired as one of the many disposable beavers tasked with cutting down <strong>Tree of Life</strong> and defeating its <strong>Protectors</strong>. Work nonstop day and night shifts to bring the tree down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And if you don't make it, don't worry. The next one will.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start your shift and get to work cutting down the Tree. Once your shift is over, <strong>buy</strong> <strong>tools\u00a0</strong>that help you cut it faster. Be careful, at <strong>night</strong>\u00a0even more <strong>Protectors</strong>\u00a0will try to defend the Tree.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't let the Protectors stop you. Find the balance between working and fighting to avoid getting fired.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 30 unique items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 Seasons with unique enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple playable characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful pixel art</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute beavers</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3536160?t=1765131808","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3536160?t=1765131808","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536160/5f2784ad6239e2d61786c8f9b03cffd62fd3f39c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765131808","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536160/5f2784ad6239e2d61786c8f9b03cffd62fd3f39c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765131808","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Experience the Timber Fever</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get hired as one of the many disposable beavers tasked with cutting down <strong>Tree of Life</strong> and defeating its <strong>Protectors</strong>. Work nonstop day and night shifts to bring the tree down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And if you don't make it, don't worry. The next one will.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start your shift and get to work cutting down the Tree. Once your shift is over, <strong>buy</strong> <strong>tools\u00a0</strong>that help you cut it faster. Be careful, at <strong>night</strong>\u00a0even more <strong>Protectors</strong>\u00a0will try to defend the Tree.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't let the Protectors stop you. Find the balance between working and fighting to avoid getting fired.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 30 unique items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 Seasons with unique enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple playable characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful pixel art</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute beavers</p></li></ul>","developers":["Virtual Ducky Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536160/b2a026af412b11e99d5f829ad0cd5ccc5285b554/header.jpg?t=1765131808","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3536160/105833109/410f7f05f15b6b57a6bb0d7e73e04bc9f0becd4f/1757663544/dash_av1.mpd?t=1757766870","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3536160/105833109/410f7f05f15b6b57a6bb0d7e73e04bc9f0becd